==Trivia==
*The {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} print of this card is one of several featured in the expansion's "Ecosystem of Stark Mountain" [[Space-Time Smackdown (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]]. All of the featured standard cards are illustrated by [[Oswaldo KATO]] and feature {{p|Heatran}}'s [[footprint]]s in the background; all four Pokémon are also featured in {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Heatran|174}}'s illustration rare print. The name of the collection implies that all of their illustrations are set in [[Stark Mountain]], where {{p|Heatran}} and {{p|Skarmory}} can be found in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}.

===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Skarmory|88}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*'''Metal Arms''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Cobalion|129}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

